{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type ReactComponentTree = object;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/AppForm/componentMap.public.ts#L20","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/react-form/src/AppForm/componentMap.public.ts:20"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A recursively nested collection of components registered with\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createFormHook"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Component trees are inferred from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"fieldComponents"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"formComponents"},{"type":"text","value":" in\nnormal usage. This type is primarily useful when building wrappers around\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createFormHook"},{"type":"text","value":" or declaring reusable component registries."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"index-signature","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Index Signature"}]},{"type":"code","value":"[name: string]: FunctionComponent<any> | ReactComponentTree","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const fields = {\n  inputs: {\n    TextField,\n  },\n} satisfies ReactComponentTree","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"index-signature","text":"Index Signature","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype ReactComponentTree = object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-form/src/AppForm/componentMap.public.ts:20](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/AppForm/componentMap.public.ts#L20)\n\nA recursively nested collection of components registered with\n`createFormHook`.\n\nComponent trees are inferred from `fieldComponents` and `formComponents` in\nnormal usage. This type is primarily useful when building wrappers around\n`createFormHook` or declaring reusable component registries.\n\n## Index Signature\n\n```ts\n[name: string]: FunctionComponent<any> | ReactComponentTree\n```\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nconst fields = {\n  inputs: {\n    TextField,\n  },\n} satisfies ReactComponentTree\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ReactComponentTree\ntitle: ReactComponentTree\n---\n\n```ts\ntype ReactComponentTree = object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/react-form/src/AppForm/componentMap.public.ts:20](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/react-form/src/AppForm/componentMap.public.ts#L20)\n\nA recursively nested collection of components registered with\n`createFormHook`.\n\nComponent trees are inferred from `fieldComponents` and `formComponents` in\nnormal usage. This type is primarily useful when building wrappers around\n`createFormHook` or declaring reusable component registries.\n\n## Index Signature\n\n```ts\n[name: string]: FunctionComponent<any> | ReactComponentTree\n```\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nconst fields = {\n  inputs: {\n    TextField,\n  },\n} satisfies ReactComponentTree\n```\n"}
